# Light-section paragraph color

On **white**, **grey (`#FAFAFA`)**, **yellow-tint cards**, and any other light background:

- Paragraphs, subtitles, and descriptions use `text-muted`
- `text-muted` is subtle black `#444444` (`rgb(68 68 68)`) — dark and readable, not pure `#000`
- Headings stay `text-heading` (`#222222`)
- Never use washed-out grey (`#A2AFB5`, `text-gray-400`, `text-slate-400`) for body copy on light sections
- Never use `text-black` or `#000` for paragraphs on light sections

On black/dark sections, body text stays `text-white/70` (FAQ answers on black: `text-accent`). Copy on dark cards stays `text-white/60`.
